          "presentation": {
            "expression": "guarded",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "hostility_major_001_03",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "続けたいなら、普通の言葉で最初からやり直して。",
